[# narrative_tldr.j2 — 4-paragraph executive narrative for non-trivial refactor / migration / bugfix PRs.
   Sits ABOVE the delta_table so the reviewer has framing before the numbers (Trait 8).

   Variables expected in scope:
     problem_md:        paragraph 1 — what was wrong + key headline metric (markdown; 2-5 sentences)
     cause_md:          paragraph 2 — root cause mechanism (markdown; 2-5 sentences)
     fix_md:            paragraph 3 — what you did + key result metric (markdown; 2-5 sentences)
     safety_md:         paragraph 4 — semantic preservation + scope boundary (markdown; 2-5 sentences)
     cause_label:       paragraph 2 bold label (default 'Why it was slow' for perf;
                        override to 'Why it broke' for bugfix, 'Why the old shape hurt' for schema)
     safety_label:      paragraph 4 bold label (default "Why it's safe";
                        override to "Why this won't regress" / "Why the migration is reversible" etc.)

   Inline form (copy without [% include %]):
     ## TL;DR

     **The problem**

     <problem narrative>

     **Why it was slow**     [or "Why it broke", etc.]

     <cause narrative>

     **The fix**

     <fix narrative>

     **Why it's safe**       [or "Why this won't regress", etc.]

     <safety narrative>

     **Delta summary table**

     [[ load_json('queries/q_perf_before.json') | delta_table(load_json('queries/q_perf_after.json')) ]]
#]

## TL;DR

**The problem**

[[ problem_md ]]

**[[ cause_label | default('Why it was slow') ]]**

[[ cause_md ]]

**The fix**

[[ fix_md ]]

**[[ safety_label | default("Why it's safe") ]]**

[[ safety_md ]]
